{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "What the hell is wrong with these guys? Why would they do that?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Saddly this is war. Not all soldiers fight for their families or their countries, especially when they are drafted.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Why...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Some soldiers would rather try to invade Archades than maintain the standstill as it is. At any rate, are you alright? Sorry about that. I'm ashamed that my countrymen would do such a thing.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That was scary, but 'I'm ok, thank you. I would like to repay you, but I don't have anything to offer.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Don't worry about it. I'll make sure these guys get judged accordingly. We'll return to our camp and have dinner. Would you like to join us?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I'm starving! Also, could you tell me where we are?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "We are near Seafront village.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Seafront village? Are we in Occidens?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How can you not know that?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Well, I fell asleep on my fishing boat, and when I came to, I was on the shore, with my boat nowhere to be seen.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You survived a shipwreck while you were asleep? How lucky can you be?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I don't think I'm that lucky... I was looking for food but all I found was this shiny rock...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Is that an emerald?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You can have it if you want, I don't really care. Let's eat! Then I feel like coming with you. You guys seem nice!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 22,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Welcome aboard, I guess.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        }
    ]
}